hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"223","Astawdi`ullāha dīnak, wa amānatak, wa khawātīma `amalik. ¤ ¤ I leave your religion in the care of Allah, as well as your safety, and the last of your deeds."
"224","Zawwadaka ‘llāhut-taqwā, wa ghafara dhanbak, wa yassara laka ‘l-khayra ḥaythu mā kunt. ¤ ¤ May Allah give you piety as your provision, forgive your sins, and make goodness easy for you wherever you are."
